  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SDG Impact - Making private capital work for SDG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SDG Impact aims to map progress and investment opportunities supporting the SDGs in developing countries, and to mainstream and drive investor interest and capital to discrete social or environmental outcomes aligned with the SDGs. Central objectives are to promote investor interest in opportunities for investment in developing countries that have significant positive impact and progress towards gender and environmental goals.</narrative>
  </description>
